{
  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "The deviation is established on the platform's own recorded distances: POL-RD-22 measures it as trip_record.actual_distance_km 22.9 km minus trip_record.optimal_distance_km 21.3 km = 1.60 km, which is above POL-RD-22's 1.0 km tolerance. The within-tolerance rows (c) and (e) of POL-RD-24 therefore cannot apply, and the case must be decided on row (a), (b) or (d).",
